# Faculty Member Tracker

A simple project designed to help students check faculty availability and basic faculty information.

## Features

* View faculty member details
* Check faculty availability
* Track department and subject information
* Simple and student-friendly interface

## Technology Used

* Python
* VS Code

## Purpose

This project was created as a beginner-level academic project to practice programming and build a useful faculty tracking system.

## Future Improvements

* Add a database
* Add login functionality
* Add real-time availability
* Create a web-based interface

